<title>NETHERLANDS: Albright to visit U.N. war crimes tribunal.</title>
<headline>Albright to visit U.N. war crimes tribunal.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Secretary of State Madeleine Albright will meet Chief Prosecutor Louise Arbour at the U.N. war crimes tribunal for the former Yugoslavia in The Hague on Wednesday, the tribunal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Albright is accompanying U.S. President Bill Clinton, who is due in the Netherlands on Tuesday evening as part of a European trip which also includes France and Britain.</p>
</text>
